                <h3 class="postingHeader">Job Description and Duties</h3>
                <p class="postingContent">
                    <p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 8pt; line-height: 1.07917;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">STUDENT ASSISTANT - MUSIC THERAPY INTERN<br /></span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">The Department of State Hospitals-Napa, Rehabilitation Therapy Services Department has an intermittent-actual time worked vacancy&nbsp;for Student Assistant-Music Therapy Intern.&nbsp;Please contact </span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">the music therapy internship director at </span><span style="font-family: Arial;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="mailto:DSHNSH_MTInternshipDirector@dsh.ca.gov" style="text-decoration: none;"><span style="color: #0563c1; text-decoration: underline;">DSHNSH_MTInternshipDirector@dsh.ca.gov</span></a></span></span><span style="font-size: 12pt;"> with</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;"> any questions.<br /><br /></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Applications will be screened and only the most competitive candidates will be invited for an interview. &nbsp;</span>Failure to include necessary documents may also exclude you from the hiring process. This advertisement may be used to fill multiple&nbsp;vacancies. Position will be filled based upon budget approval.<br /><br />Applicants possessing experience working with adult patients in a psychiatric and/or forensic facility are preferred. Expectations for entering internship include completion of coursework towards a degree in Music Therapy with the anticipated completion of a bachelor’s degree or equivalency from a university with a program approved by the American Music Therapy Association.&nbsp;<br /><br /></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">Applications will be accepted until position is filled. Multiple cut off dates are set for application submission: March 1, 2025, April 1, 2025, and May 1, 2025. Applications received after a cutoff date will be processed on the next cutoff date. </span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br /><br /><strong style="background-color: #00ff00;">Please see &quot;SPECIAL REQUIREMENTS&quot; below for additional information required with STD.678 application.</strong><br /></span></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><br /><br /></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;"><strong>To ensure that your application will be considered for this recruitment the following items are required:</strong><em><strong><br /><br /></strong></em></span></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: left; margin: 0pt;">• You must complete the STD. 678 Employment Application in its entirety and include, &quot;<span style="font-weight: bold;">Student Assistant</span>-&nbsp;<span style="font-weight: bold;">Music Therapy Intern&nbsp;- JC# 464155</span><span style="font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;</span>in the “Job Title(s)” section of the application.&nbsp;<br /><br /></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span>•&nbsp;Duties Performed and Supervisor’s name and Contact information must be completed on the STD 678 -&nbsp;</span><span style="font-weight: bold;">Incomplete applications will not be considered.<br /><br /></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">•&nbsp; Attach current college transcripts and&nbsp;Proof of application for, or enrollment as a student in, an appropriate college or&nbsp;university program.&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Foreign transcripts must be evaluated and submitted with application STD. 678</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;"> </span></p><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br /></span><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: left; margin: 0pt;">• Completed <strong>Music Therapy Internship Supplemental Application with&nbsp;</strong><strong style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="text-decoration-line: underline;">ALL&nbsp;</span></strong><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">additional information requested in &quot;SPECIAL REQUIREMENTS&quot;&nbsp;</span></p><br /><br /><p style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><strong> </strong></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;"> </span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;"></span><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;"> </span></p><p>You will find additional information about the job in the <strong><a href='https://www.CalCareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/FileDownload.aspx?aid=26278373&name=DutyStatement.pdf' target='_blank'>Duty Statement</a></strong>.</p>
