                <h3 class="postingHeader">Special Requirements</h3>
                <div class="postingContent">
		
                    <ul>
                        
                        
                        
                        
                        
                        <li id="rowSpecialRequirementBackgroundCheck">
                            <span id="lblSpecialRequirement_BackgroundCheck">The position(s) require(s) a Background Investigation be cleared prior to being hired.</span></li>
                        <li id="rowSpecialRequirementMedicalEval">
                            <span id="lblSpecialRequirement_MedicalEval">The position(s) require(s) Medical Clearance prior to being hired.</span></li>
                        

                        
                        
                    </ul>
                
	</div>
                <div class="postingContent">
                    <span id="lblSpecialRequirementText"><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;">SPECIAL REQUIREMENTS: Please include with your application a separate document with answers to all the following questions:</span><br /><br /> </span></p><ol start="1" style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">
			<li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Why did you choose to enter the field of Music Therapy?</span></li><li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">For what reasons did you select DSH-Napa as a music therapy clinical training site? </span></li><li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Please describe three things you learned from your field experience. In what areas did you see personal growth? Professional growth? How did you address and include cultural diversity in your sessions? </span></li><li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">What are your areas of strength and weakness when working with this specific population? </span></li><li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">What do you most hope to gain from your internship experience?</span></li><li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">List three treatment goals that might be addressed in music therapy with a forensic/mental health population. Describe one possible music therapy intervention for each goal.</span></li><li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">List any other special skills, personal traits, interests, and accomplishments that you bring to this position. What do you have to offer that makes you unique?</span></li></ol><span style="font-size: 12pt;">
		</span><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;">ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:</span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold;">&nbsp;</span></p><ol start="1" style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">
			<li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Please submit three (3) letters of recommendation. One (1) must be from your music therapy advisor and one (1) from a clinical music therapy supervisor. These letters must include an assessment of your interpersonal skills, music skills, and knowledge of music therapy practice and procedure. The third letter can be at your discretion (though no relatives please), perhaps a music professor familiar with your musical skills, or a professor who can attest to why you would be a good candidate for our internship program.</span></li><li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Signed and dated verification of eligibility for internship from your academic supervisor.</span></li><li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Current resumé or CV that includes practicum experience</span></li><li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Audition - Please video yourself and include a link to the videos in a document. Submit this document with your application. Demonstration of musical skills through the following: </span></li></ol><span style="font-size: 12pt;">
		</span><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;">&nbsp;</span></span></p><ol style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">
			</ol><ol style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">
				<li style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt; list-style-type: lower-latin; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Play your choice of 3 different major keys with a I-vi-IV-V-I chord progression on keyboard and guitar using different musical styles. Improvise vocally over one on each instrument.</span></li><li style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt; list-style-type: lower-latin; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Play your choice of 2 different minor keys with the same chord progression on keyboard and guitar. Improvise vocally over one on each instrument. </span></li><li style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt; list-style-type: lower-latin; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Sing two songs with self-accompaniment on either keyboard or guitar.</span> </span></li></ol></span>
                </div>
            
</div>

